{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Octane100</strong> is a pixel turn-based action game where a single item can flip the entire battle in the war against the oil corporation Octane100.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/0c3492b1564fe4c16031fe89354acb4b.webp?t=1761234687\" width=349 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br>Imagine: you\u2019re left with <strong>1 HP</strong> against Octane100\u2019s final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No chance. Period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in your hands \u2014 the right item. And that\u2019s what makes the impossible\u2026 possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Octane100, victory isn\u2019t just about strength \u2014 it\u2019s about your ability to <strong>find and use the perfect artifact at the perfect moment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/da9ede819f0e83e8c4daea29aed8f34b.poster.avif?t=1761234687\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/da9ede819f0e83e8c4daea29aed8f34b.webm?t=1761234687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/da9ede819f0e83e8c4daea29aed8f34b.mp4?t=1761234687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 heroes</strong> with unique abilities, fighting back against the Octane100 monopoly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ items</strong> that break the rules of combat and give you a chance even when the corporation nearly wipes you out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 difficulty levels</strong>: Easy, Hardcore, and Rogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops with unpredictable assortments and the thrill of risky purchases.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/f9ab0a7fc00540b3951d13c006cf8e96.poster.avif?t=1761234687\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/f9ab0a7fc00540b3951d13c006cf8e96.webm?t=1761234687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/f9ab0a7fc00540b3951d13c006cf8e96.mp4?t=1761234687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map mode</strong>: gather resources, build routes, and craft your own fuel to resist Octane100 on a global scale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible <strong>Hats and Trails</strong>, to keep your style sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and badges for true hunters of achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/c5321b17249200a4dabc941a70ac2d97.poster.avif?t=1761234687\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/c5321b17249200a4dabc941a70ac2d97.webm?t=1761234687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/c5321b17249200a4dabc941a70ac2d97.mp4?t=1761234687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Love tactics and risk?</strong> Every battle here is a chance to turn defeat into a brilliant victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>A roguelike fan?</strong> The minimalist look hides surprisingly deep mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/extras/146b6ec00928708ecca8926379d7c37f.webp?t=1761234687\" width=349 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3471070?t=1761234687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/d82437f87ae7c7ff68623fe4caa0446956d0ef50/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761234687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/e1dce1d225f259f6e3a9f4d5cbcca26e77f92b01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761234687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471070/e1dce1d225f259f6e3a9f4d5cbcca26e77f92b01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761234687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3958140,"description":""},{"appid":3958140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Octane100</strong> is a pixel turn-based action game where a single item can flip the entire battle in the war against the oil corporation Octane100.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><